---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Outlier case study — Evelyn R."
  description="Creating coding tasks, code reviews and rubrics to train and evaluate AI coding models."
>

  <article class="case-study">
    <a href="/#work" class="case-back-float" aria-label="Back to work">←</a>
    <a href="/#work" class="case-back"><span class="arrow">←</span> Back to work</a>

    <p class="eyebrow scroll-reveal">Case study — Outlier</p>
    <h1 class="scroll-reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.06s">Training and evaluating AI coding models</h1>
    <p class="case-meta scroll-reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.12s">AI Coding Evaluator · Contract · 2026</p>
    <a href="https://outlier.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="case-live scroll-reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.18s">Visit the website <span class="arrow arrow-out">↗</span></a>

    <div class="case-body">
      <h2 class="scroll-reveal">Context</h2>
      <p class="scroll-reveal">
        AI coding models learn from examples, and they need hard, realistic tasks to show where they fail. Outlier works with AI companies to create that training and evaluation data.
      </p>

      <h2 class="scroll-reveal">What I did</h2>
      <p class="scroll-reveal">
        I created coding tasks for AI models to solve, each with tests that check whether a solution really works. I also wrote code reviews and detailed rubrics to score the models' answers.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a href="/#contact" class="case-cta scroll-reveal">Work with me →</a>
  </article>

</MainLayout>
